@startuml
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Alice (Fleet Manager)" as Alice
participant "Streamlit Dashboard" as UI
participant "DriftSupervisor (BaseStation)" as SV
participant "Network Driver (ISR / DMA)" as ISR
participant "MicroShield (Edge Node)" as Shield

== Scenario 1: Proactive Detection & Tier 1 Soft Isolation ==
[-> ISR : Incoming Packet Buffer (Malicious Flooding)
activate ISR
ISR -> Shield : microshield_classify(features)
activate Shield
note over Shield : O(d) Bounded Inference
Shield --> ISR : Return VERDICT = 1 (THREAT)
deactivate Shield
ISR -> ISR : Reset Hardware DMA Pointers
note over ISR : Frame dropped before application ingestion
ISR -> UI : Async Dispatch "TelemetryAlert" (Via Service Line)
deactivate ISR
activate UI
UI -> UI : Log Intrusion Event
UI --> Alice : Flash Red Alert Notification
deactivate UI

== Scenario 2: Remote Override State (Falsi Positivi) ==
Alice -> UI : Review Logs & Assert False Positive
activate UI
UI -> ISR : Transmit "OverrideCommand" (Cryptographically Signed)
deactivate UI
activate ISR
ISR -> Shield : Reset Edge Mitigation Flags & Timers
activate Shield
note over Shield : Clear Exponential Backoff
Shield --> ISR : Confirmed Status Nominal
deactivate Shield
ISR -> ISR : Set Green LED State
deactivate ISR

== Scenario 3: Agnostic Network Drift Escalation (Falsi Negativi) ==
[-> ISR : Silent Attack Frame (Bypasses Local Model)
activate ISR
ISR -> Shield : microshield_classify(features)
activate Shield
Shield --> ISR : Return VERDICT = 0 (SAFE)
deactivate Shield
ISR -> SV : Forward Agnostic Transport Metadata
deactivate ISR
activate SV
SV -> SV : Analyze Historical Packet Frequency Baseline
note over SV #FFCCCC : Network Drift Detected! / Heartbeat Timeout
SV -> UI : Force Global Security Escalation Directive
deactivate SV
activate UI
UI -> ISR : Dispatch Mandatory "Hard Isolation" Order
deactivate UI
activate ISR
ISR -> Shield : Transition to TIER 2 (LOCKDOWN)
activate Shield
note over Shield : Shutdown logical network channels
Shield --> ISR : Confirmed Lock
deactivate Shield
ISR -> ISR : Set Solid Red LED State
deactivate ISR
@enduml

